                    "description": {
                      "value": "Your flair keeps foes' attention, as your motions with your gun draw your foes into a deadly game. As you toy with them and performatively brandish your weapon, you build their tunnel vision, leaving them trapped in a perceptual gauntlet of your own making. Attempt a Performance check against the Will DC of a single target within your one-handed firearm's first range increment.\n\nCritical Success: The target takes a \u20132 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn.\nSuccess: The target takes a \u20131 status penalty to attack rolls against creatures other than you until the beginning of your next turn."
